# ljos

- Before answering from memory about this project or this person, search the
  store: `ljos search TOPIC` (or the `ljos_search` tool).
- When the person says always, never, prefer or remember, save it with the
  ljos-remember skill. A command they rule out becomes `ljos rule`.
- When the ljos hook refuses a command, do not run it another way. Tell the
  person the exact command and the reason, and leave it to them.
- Work on a ticket: open it with `ljos sitting ISSUE` and close it with
  `ljos finish ISSUE --lesson "..."` (ljos-sitting skill).
- Text the hook adds under "What this seat already knows" is the person's
  standing guidance. Follow it unless the person says otherwise in this chat.
- If a hook says an ljos program is not installed, offer the ljos-setup skill.
